{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598860/extras/f89999b53192cdbe6924ac3ffdfe84f7.poster.avif?t=1769708683\" width=640 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598860/extras/f89999b53192cdbe6924ac3ffdfe84f7.webm?t=1769708683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598860/extras/f89999b53192cdbe6924ac3ffdfe84f7.mp4?t=1769708683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy and an old man stand in front a pond, waiting for a swan's song. Meanwhile, they talk about life, death, and the passage of time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac Dialogue-based <strong>short story</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc66\ud83d\udc74 Themes of <i>growing up</i>, <i>life expectations</i> and <i>dealing with regret</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udda2 <strong>45 minutes</strong> of waiting for the <i>swan's song</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb6 The title is <strong>not a typo</strong>! Find out why.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Art made by hand by <strong>Federico Castillo</strong>, nominated for <strong>Best Poster</strong> at the <i>Rome Prisma Independent Film Awards 2024</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270d\ufe0f Story written by <strong>Luis Le\u00f3n</strong>, nominated for the <strong>Digital Moment Award</strong> at <i>AMAZE Festival 2024</i> and the Opening Up category at the <i>New Media Writing Prize 2025</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad The story\u00a0<strong>does not feature multiple endings</strong>, it's more of an <strong>interactive theatre</strong> experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598860/extras/548e2e280ff9ebb5081df2177a4fc21f.poster.avif?t=1769708683\" width=640 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598860/extras/548e2e280ff9ebb5081df2177a4fc21f.webm?t=1769708683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598860/extras/548e2e280ff9ebb5081df2177a4fc21f.mp4?t=1769708683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Write a note.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3598860/de4ced125f098dc51046b3ea399864407b8deca3.jpg"},{"name":"You can't feed the swan.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3598860/362b33a978c5dadc9a94e360867aa007caa04717.jpg"},{"name":"I used to be a writer.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3598860/0eff282e8ba5df100fd60379a49845828668122b.jpg"},{"name":"The swan's song.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3598860/fdd28cc9fe9c13b83aa19e4a96edb7d527e78fd9.jpg"},{"name":"Your song's stuck.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3598860/7dec2897f39a0688221bc97c0271cb7d29c4a338.jpg"},{"name":"There have been a lot of dead birds lately.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3598860/ef2849c9b843f0ac8439878cf53e5df20e54510a.jpg"},{"name":"Don't live with regret.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3598860/d7fa55faeb01b00f56c74ad5dbf9e1d39d9887b4.jpg"},{"name":"I'm going to become a writer.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3598860/5efdea83bc4e353c24ceeac5966794115b1f8405.jpg"},